{"id":60516142010467,"type":"artist","name":"Katatonia","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":16,"info":{"img":"https://cdn-images.dzcdn.net/images/artist/2de3d159f89709e5aa6c52eb8ea30ab0/1000x1000-000000-80-0-0.jpg","bio":"Katatonia se formó en el 1991, por el dúo compuesto por Anders Nyström (Blakkheim) y Jonas Renkse (Lord Seth), los cuales, tras la incorporación del bajista Guillaume Le Huch, publicaron su primera demo titulada Jhva Elohim Meth. Un año después dicho demo se publicaría como un EP.\n\nEn 1993 graban su primer disco, Dance of December Souls. Sus primeros lanzamientos se encuadran en un sonido marcado por la influencia del black metal depresivo (por lo que respecta a los desgarrados gritos de Renkse) y el doom épico","tags":["doom metal","Progressive metal","depressive rock","Gothic Metal","metal"]},"works":[{"id":142495761870329,"type":"album","name":"Dance of December Souls","artist":"Katatonia","year":1993,"weight":11,"yt":"nlPXiDZqUpE","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":31538438098055,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Black Metal","rank":104,"scaruffi":null},{"id":34791388276823,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Death Doom Metal","rank":12,"scaruffi":null},{"id":68116810416510,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Gothic Metal","rank":12,"scaruffi":null},{"id":68519467142167,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Doom Metal","rank":46,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":5}},{"id":78676222508144,"type":"album","name":"Brave Murder Day","artist":"Katatonia","year":1996,"weight":9,"yt":"P7ClLHaO-DM","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":34791388276823,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Death Doom Metal","rank":3,"scaruffi":null},{"id":68116810416510,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Gothic Metal","rank":2,"scaruffi":null},{"id":68519467142167,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Doom Metal","rank":10,"scaruffi":null},{"id":175315787363075,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Metal","rank":129,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":4}},{"id":6321078418450,"type":"album","name":"Discouraged Ones","arti